WEBVTT

00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:33.913
thanks to machine learning algorithms,
such as neural networks.

00:01:33.996 --> 00:01:37.496
These consist of artificial nodes
that mimic our biological neurons

00:01:37.538 --> 00:01:41.288
by forming connections
and exchanging information.

00:01:41.329 --> 00:01:45.121
To train the network, sample inputs
pre-classified into different categories,

00:01:45.163 --> 00:01:47.788
such as photos marked happy or sad,

00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:50.079
are fed into the system.

00:01:50.121 --> 00:01:53.079
The network then learns
to classify those samples

00:01:53.121 --> 00:01:57.329
by adjusting the relative weights
assigned to particular features.

00:01:57.371 --> 00:01:59.371
The more training data it's given,

00:01:59.413 --> 00:02:02.204
the better the algorithm becomes
at identifying new images.